cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  Teach Your Database to LIKE Strings via Efficient Wildcard
  Joins and Filters
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the paper it belongs
  to.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/lamduynguyen/wildcard-join"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for the paper. Holds the wildcard
  join prototype, the SQL schema, load scripts and benchmark
  queries for the HackerNews evaluation, and the three system
  binaries the evaluation compares. The two Umbra binaries are
  closed source and cannot be rebuilt, see
  docs/umbra-binaries.md.
